{'symbol': 'PNC', 'date': '2022-02-02 10:40:00', 'title': 'HARRIS WILLIAMS ADVISES MEDICAL KNOWLEDGE GROUP, LLC ON ITS SALE TO NOVO HOLDINGS A/S', 'text': 'RICHMOND, VA.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--HARRIS WILLIAMS, A GLOBAL INVESTMENT BANK SPECIALIZING IN M&A ADVISORY SERVICES, ANNOUNCES IT ADVISED MEDICAL KNOWLEDGE GROUP, LLC (MKG), A PORTFOLIO COMPANY OF COURT SQUARE CAPITAL PARTNERS (COURT SQUARE) AND AISLING CAPITAL (AISLING), ON ITS SALE TO NOVO HOLDINGS A/S (NOVO HOLDINGS). MKG IS AN ANALYTICS-DRIVEN COMMERCIALIZATION PLATFORM DELIVERING HEALTHCARE PROVIDER TARGETED INSIGHTS AND SOLUTIONS THAT MAXIMIZE THE CLINICAL AND COMMERCIAL POTENTIAL OF BIOP'}